    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like \"merchandising\" though. it felt heavy. like a signal. the blue of the soap right next to the orange of the pumpkins... it was so high-contrast it actually hurt my eyes for a second. and the cinnamon was right there too. why would they put them in that exact order? if you look at the archetypes or the meanings behind those specific things, isn't there a deeper connection there? like a message for someone to pick up on?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
